--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 75e7bea227aaf2b499307efe1ddc0480, type: 3}
  m_Name: MerchantDialog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialog
  NPCName: Merchant
  DialogLines:
  - text: "Careful\u2026 the containment lattice is barely holding."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: When the data storm struck, the Core fractured into three primary shards.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Each shard now holds a different layer of your identity.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The reactor cannot repair itself until those fragments are recovered.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The shards are scattered across three sectors of the city.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The West Sector holds the Archives.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The East Sector contains the Systems District.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: And the South Sector... it leads into the Deep Network.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Recover the fragments from each sector and bring them back here.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "Once the Core has all three pieces\u2026 it may be able to rebuild itself."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: "But something about the fracture pattern is wrong\u2026 reactors don't
      just fail like this."
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: It is almost as if the system rejected something.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: Go now. Choose a sector and recover the first shard.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
  - text: The Core will respond when you return.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices: []
